OL,3,GNEWSARiding for the Disabled's IOM
OL,4,Afounder 'very proud' of 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 50th anniversary of the Isle of
OL,7,FMan's Riding for the Disabled
OL,8,FAssociation branch has made its
OL,9,Flast-remaining founder "very proud" of
OL,10,Fa "very exciting" moment.
OL,12,FBrenda Charlton moved to the island in
OL,13,F1972 after being involved with the
OL,14,Fcharity in England.
OL,16,FAfter seeing a newspaper notice about a
OL,17,Fmeeting to form a local group, she said
OL,18,F"not knowing a soul, I went along". The
OL,19,Fgroup began riding in September 1976,
OL,20,Finitially with six ponies on loan.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
